OL,3,GNEWSAReduced street cleaning due to
OL,4,Adepot fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council says it is working to
OL,7,Fminimise disruption to its services
OL,8,Fafter a fire broke out at a waste and
OL,9,Frecycling depot.
OL,11,FGloucestershire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,12,F(GFRS) said it attended the fire at
OL,13,F21:13 GMT on Monday at the Ubico depot
OL,14,Fon Eastern Avenue in Gloucester.
OL,16,FGloucester City Council, which jointly
OL,17,Fowns Ubico with several other local
OL,18,Fauthorities, said two compact street
OL,19,Fsweepers, three street cleansing cage
OL,20,Fvehicles and a 7.5-tonne refuse
OL,21,Fcollection vehicle, were damaged.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
